{
  "id": "zero_sum.maximin_le_minimax",
  "title": "Maximin is Bounded by Minimax",
  "kind": "lemma",
  "status": "admitted",
  "href": "zero_sum/zero_sum_maximin_le_minimax.html",
  "body_html": "<h1>Maximin is Bounded by Minimax</h1>\n<p>For every finite matrix game,</p>\n<p>$$\\max_x \\min_j E_A(x,j) \\le \\min_y \\max_i E_A(i,y).$$</p>\n<p>This is the weak-duality inequality: player I's best guaranteed payoff cannot\nexceed player II's best upper bound on player I's payoff.</p>",
